      "label": "common_0225_rival_08",
      "hash64": "B93CA11B985934A2",
      "text": "本来必须要先上过专门的课之后\\n才能拿到这个的……\\r\\n不过，我已经推荐你了！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "common_0225_rival_09",
      "hash64": "B93CA21B98593655",
      "text": "你试试就知道了！一边对战，\\n一边了解怎么用它吧～！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "common_0225_sitappa_b_09",
      "hash64": "0EE60B3AC5DDB2A4",
      "text": "咦？看这个发展，\\n我是要被用来做太晶的测试吗……？[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "common_0225_rival_10",
      "hash64": "B9400F1B985C2563",
      "text": "如果你不愿意的话，就要和我对战哦。[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "common_0225_sitappa_b_10",
      "hash64": "0EE2FE3AC5DB66B6",
      "text": "……呃呃～\\n和那个新面孔对战的话，\\r\\n我还是有机会能赢的！[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "common_0225_rival_11",
      "hash64": "B9400E1B985C23B0",
      "text": "好，各就各位！\\n对战～开始～！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "common_0225_rival_22",
      "hash64": "B9361F1B9853EC0E",
      "text": "真～不愧是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！\\n太晶化的感觉也很棒！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "common_0225_rival_23",
      "hash64": "B936201B9853EDC1",
      "text": "真～不愧是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！\\n你都没太晶化就赢了呀！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
